From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] translit: Uzbek Latin/Cyrillic commands for cell text (new engine module, uz-translit dependency)

The command registry is a closed OnceLock, so the three transliteration commands (tools.translitCyrl, tools.translitLatn,
tools.translitAuto) are a new engine module, crates/engine/src/cmd/translit.rs, registered in command_specs(). It converts the
text of constant text cells in the selection, the sheet or the workbook through the uz-translit rules (an in-monorepo path
dependency) and skips formulas with their cached values, numbers, booleans, table header cells, locked cells of protected
sheets and sheet names. One command is one undo step (it runs through edit()). Tests: crates/engine/tests/translit.rs.
